<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`AGENT_ALWAYS_RUN: number = 4096`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer AGENT_ALWAYS_RUN = 4096;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant AGENT_ALWAYS_RUN has the value 0x1000</p>
  <p>Used with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetAgentInfo" target="_blank">llGetAgentInfo</a> to determine if the queried avatar has 'always running' set.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>AgentInfo</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
